retainers to our lord.

484
00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:53.130
And I shall proudly
fight in his name

485
00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:55.800
to the bitter end, if need be.

486
00:23:57.010 --> 00:23:58.550
Don't go!

487
00:23:58.550 --> 00:24:02.140
You can't leave me,
Kin'emon! Please!

488
00:24:02.140 --> 00:24:06.390
I can't stand to
lose anyone else!

489
00:24:09.020 --> 00:24:11.190
[ODEN]
Listen up, all of you!

490
00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:14.360
This country has been
isolated for centuries.

491
00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:16.280
As its stewards,
it is a decision

492
00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:19.030
deeply tied to the Kozuki Clan.

493
00:24:19.030 --> 00:24:21.030
But the times are changing!

494
00:24:21.030 --> 00:24:24.080
This world will soon
enter a new era.

495
00:24:24.080 --> 00:24:25.700
Before this comes to pass,

496
00:24:25.700 --> 00:24:28.880
our Land of Wano must be
prepared to meet it.

497
00:24:28.880 --> 00:24:32.170
We must open our borders!

498
00:24:53.020 --> 00:24:56.860
[NARRATOR]
The tale of Oden
begins 41 years ago,

499
00:24:56.860 --> 00:24:58.950
in the Flower Capital.

500
00:25:00.200 --> 00:25:03.160
[TOWNSPERSON A]
Kozuki Oden has returned!

501
00:25:03.160 --> 00:25:04.700
Hide your wives, quickly!

502
00:25:04.700 --> 00:25:06.380
[TOWNSPERSON C]
And your daughters, too!

503
00:25:06.380 --> 00:25:09.260
Hide the livestock, quick!
Hide the livestock!

504
00:25:06.410 --> 00:25:11.680
[Women gasp]

505
00:25:11.680 --> 00:25:14.470
Looks like his latest
escape plan must have failed.

506
00:25:14.470 --> 00:25:17.730
What is wrong with you?
Don't you ever learn?

507
00:25:17.730 --> 00:25:20.140
[NARRATOR]
The man was
well-known in the capital,

508
00:25:20.140 --> 00:25:23.440
but not always well-liked.
